---
title: "updateStatusesForNewAcademicYear (stem-system: Bulk Academic Year Update)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_admin: checkAdmin()
    q_check_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: admin confirmed
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error
    q_validate --> q_check_gen: highSchoolFirstYearGeneration > 0?
    q_check_gen --> q_invalid: invalid generation
    q_check_gen --> q_compute: valid
    q_invalid --> [*]: return error (invalid generation)
    q_compute --> q_calc_ranges: compute HS generations [g, g-1, g-2] and JHS generations [g+1, g+2, g+3]
    q_calc_ranges --> q_count: count total active members (deleted_at is null)
    q_count --> q_update_hs: adminClient.members.update(status=1) where generation in HS range
    q_update_hs --> q_update_jhs: adminClient.members.update(status=0) where generation in JHS range
    q_update_jhs --> q_update_ob: adminClient.members.update(status=2) where generation NOT in any student range
    q_update_ob --> q_sync_all: syncAllDiscordRoles()
    q_sync_all --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success with count message

    note right of q_calc_ranges
        INV-001: HS 1st year = g, 2nd year = g-1, 3rd year = g-2
        INV-002: JHS 3rd year = g+1, 2nd year = g+2, 1st year = g+3
        INV-003: any member not in student generations becomes OB/OG (status=2)
    end note

    note right of q_update_ob
        INV-004: uses adminClient to bypass RLS for bulk updates
        INV-005: only non-deleted members are updated (deleted_at is null)
    end note
